{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing solo or with friends, Blessed delivers nonstop action, strategic depth, and a cosmic narrative of power, sacrifice, and survival.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Hero</strong> <br>Select your class and play with one of five cosmic stones \u2014Healing, Rage, Agility, Vision, or Armor\u2014. Each one of them is specialized for a unique play-style. Also gain new perks to be able to buy in the shop section between waves. <br><br><strong>Abilities</strong> <br>Charge aura through combat to unleash special moves \u2014support crates, bombs, turrets, \u2014 that defines your play-style. <br><br><strong>Game Loop</strong> <br>Survive endless waves of ever\u2011tougher enemies solo or co\u2011op. As you progress, the playground shifts to new arenas \u2014from elemental realms to space battlegrounds\u2014 to keep the action fresh.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688960?t=1753049838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688960/9f333f06918fc2bae122ea2814e372ba7e655336/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753049838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688960/1673f7d7b54c97f2750a89f95f21f94cf59fddf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753049838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688960/1673f7d7b54c97f2750a89f95f21f94cf59fddf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753049838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing solo or with friends, Blessed delivers nonstop action, strategic depth, and a cosmic narrative of power, sacrifice, and survival.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Hero</strong> <br>Select your class and play with one of five cosmic stones \u2014Healing, Rage, Agility, Vision, or Armor\u2014. Each one of them is specialized for a unique play-style. Also gain new perks to be able to buy in the shop section between waves. <br><br><strong>Abilities</strong> <br>Charge aura through combat to unleash special moves \u2014support crates, bombs, turrets, \u2014 that defines your play-style. <br><br><strong>Game Loop</strong> <br>Survive endless waves of ever\u2011tougher enemies solo or co\u2011op. As you progress, the playground shifts to new arenas \u2014from elemental realms to space battlegrounds\u2014 to keep the action fresh.</p>","developers":["Team Sermath"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688960/70f826e30d4a955c7a66a43713e05fe9203589f6/header.jpg?t=1753049838","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688960/254842623/706b8d9f870daa29205d27b136e9ae627e77bd0b/1750403532/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749666629","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688960/254842623/706b8d9f870daa29205d27b136e9ae627e77bd0b/1750403532/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749666629","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688960/254842623/706b8d9f870daa29205d27b136e9ae627e77bd0b/1750403532/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749666629","id":257154485,"name":"Blessed Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat